A '''Blessed Fruit''' is a {{Rare}} [[Reforge Stone]] that applies the {{ReforgingLink|Blessed}} [[Reforge]] to a [[Farming Tool]]. It grants {{stat|fmf}}, {{stat|speed}} and {{stat|fmw}}.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Blessed Fruit''' can purchased from the {{NPCSprite|Smithmonger}} for {{C|1m}}.

==Usage==
===Reforging===
'''Blessed Fruit''' can be combined with a [[Farming Tool]] using an [[Anvil]] or [[The Hex]] to apply the {{Reforge|Blessed}} reforge, to grant {{Stat|fmf}}, {{stat|spd}} and {{stat|fmw}}, which scale with the Farming Tool's rarity. This has a skill requirement of {{skill|mining|25}}. A Farming Tool that is already reforged to {{reforge|Blessed}} will grant the stats, even if the player doesn't meet the requirement to apply it.

Additionally, it grants the '''{{blue|Blessed Bonus}}''', which grants {{chance|0.25%|1|400}} chance to find enchanted forms of items when harvesting crops. 

