== Trivia ==
*The {{stat|spd}} bonus used to be applied for each unique hoe in the inventory.
*Before the addition of {{Stat|Farming Wisdom}}, the farming exp bonus from the blessed reforge was additive with the {{Item|Rabbit Pet}}'s {{AN|Farming Exp Boost}} perk and {{NPCSprite|Derpy}}'s {{AN|MOAR SKILLZ!!!}} perk unlike other skill bonuses. <ref>https://hypixel.net/threads/additive-farming-exp-bonuses-rabbit-pet-blessed-reforge-derpy.4857999/</ref>
*When the '''Blessed''' bonus activates, the following message is sent in chat:
{{Dialogue|&9&lBLESSED! &fYou found an  &7<enchanted item>&f!}}

